msgstr "Scan face modely"

#: src/onboarding.py:563
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Tsy afaka mitahiry endrika endrika"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Scan modely faharoa"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Tsy afaka nandrakitra ny maodely faharoa"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Voatahiry ny maodely voalohany anao, ka efa mandeha ny fidirana amin'n"
"y tarehy. Ataovy azo antoka fa mazava tsara ny tavanao ary mifantoka t"
"sara, dia andramo indray -- na tsidiho ary ampio modely avy eo amin'ny"
" Settings."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Manampia modely tarehy (ilaina)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Mila modely tarehy iray farafahakeliny ny fidirana amin'ny tarehy, ka "
"tsy azo adinoina ity scan ity. Raketo amin'ny hazavana ipetrahanao mat"
"etika izy io. Manova ny endriky ny tarehinao amin'ny fakantsary ny jir"
"o, koa eritrereto ny manampy modely faharoa avy eo amin'ny Settings, v"
"oarakitra amin'ny hazavana samihafa (ohatra ny jiro hariva fa tsy ny a"
"ntoandro)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Manampia maodely tarehy faharoa (aroso)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Voatahiry ny modelyo voalohany. Manova ny fomba fijerin'ny fakantsary "
"ny tavanao: ny maodely voarakitra antoandro dia mety hanjavona amin'ny"
" hariva eo ambanin'ny jiro (na ny mifanohitra amin'izany aza), ary Ubu"
"ntu Hello dia tapitra ny fotoana fa tsy mamoha. Ny maodely faharoa voa"
"rakitra amin'ny hazavana samihafa dia mitazona ny fanekena azo antoka "
"amin'ny fotoana rehetra."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Ovay aloha ny jiro: asio na aforeto ny jiron'ny efitrano na ny jiron'n"
"y birao, mialà eo amin'ny varavarankely, na apetraho ny solomaso ataon"
"ao indraindray. Dia jereo mivantana ny fakantsary ary tsindrio Scan."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello Setup"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia afaka manokatra ho azy ny {} amin'ny alàlan'ny fanama"
"rinana endrika (kitapom-bola hita: {}).\n\n<b>Satan'ny TPM:</b> Mijery"
" fitaovana sy fitaovana TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia afaka manokatra ho azy ny {} amin'ny alàlan'ny fanama"
"rinana endrika (kitapom-bola hita: {}).\n\n<b>Sata TPM:</b> TPM fitaov"
"ana hita. Mametraka <i>tpm2-tools</i> ho azy..."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia afaka manokatra ho azy ny {} amin'ny alàlan'ny fanama"
"rinana endrika (kitapom-bola hita: {}).\n\n<b>Sata TPM:</b> Hardware T"
"PM 2.0 mavitrika. Ho voaisy tombo-kase tsara ao anatin'ny TPM ny tenim"
"iafinao."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia afaka manokatra ho azy ny {} amin'ny alàlan'ny fanama"
"rinana endrika (kitapom-bola hita: {}).\n\n<b>Satan'ny TPM:</b> Hita n"
"y fitaovana TPM, saingy tsy nahomby ny fametrahana <i>tpm2-tools</i> m"
"andeha ho azy. Alefaso ny <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Mi"
"verina amin'ny caching fahazoan-dàlana mifototra amin'ny rindrambaiko."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia afaka manokatra ho azy ny {} amin'ny alàlan'ny fanama"
"rinana endrika (kitapom-bola hita: {}).\n\n<b>Sata TPM:</b> Tsy misy f"
"itaovana TPM hita. Mampiasa caching fahazoan-dàlana mifototra amin'ny "
"rindrambaiko (AES-256-GCM)."

