#: src/onboarding.glade:62
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Vita ny fanamboarana!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:81
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing any"
"thing you would normally have to type your password for to authenticat"
"e, like running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unloc"
"k, your login keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically o"
"n login.\n\nYou can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to cha"
"nge more advanced settings or add additional models. Press Finish belo"
"w to close this window and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Vita isika! Ubuntu Hello dia mavitrika amin'ity solosaina ity izao. Ma"
"nandrama manao izay rehetra tsy maintsy ataonao manoratra ny tenimiafi"
"nao mba hanamarinana, toy ny fandefasana baiko amin'ny sudo. Raha nave"
"lanao ny fisokafana mandeha ho azy, ny peratra fanalahidinao na KWalle"
"t dia ho voahidy ho azy koa rehefa miditra.\n\nAzonao atao ny manokatr"
"a ny Ubuntu Hello Configurator amin'ny manaraka raha te hanova fanovan"
"a mandroso kokoa na manampy modely fanampiny. Tsindrio ny Finish eto a"
"mbany raha hanakatona ity varavarankely ity ary sokafy ny Ubuntu Hello"
" Configurator."

#: src/onboarding.glade:129
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet us"
"ing face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia afaka manokatra ho azy ny peratra fidirana na KWallet"
" amin'ny alàlan'ny fanamarinan-tarehy, hisorohana ny fampandrenesana n"
"y tenimiafina aorian'ny fidirana."

#: src/onboarding.glade:141
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Alefaso ny peratra fanalahidy mandeha ho azy/KWallet manokatra"

#: src/onboarding.glade:183
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Hamafiso ny tenimiafina"

#: src/onboarding.glade:215
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Mametraka politika azo antoka"

#: src/onboarding.glade:234
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match"
" is never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you "
"can set how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Noho ny fiovan'ny zoro, ny halavirana, ary ny anton-javatra hafa dia t"
"sy mitovy velively amin'ny maodely tarehy voatahiry ny lalaon'ny tareh"
"y. Amin'ity pejy ity dia azonao atao ny mametraka ny tokony ho hentitr"
"a Ubuntu Hello."

#: src/onboarding.glade:273
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "fifadian-kanina"

#: src/onboarding.glade:289
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \nbut speeds up the scanning process greatl"
"y."
msgstr ""
"Mamela lalao manjavozavo kokoa, \nfa manafaingana be ny fizotry ny sca"
"n."

#: src/onboarding.glade:328
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "mandanjalanja"

#: src/onboarding.glade:344
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \nbut might not log you in when furt"
"her away."
msgstr ""
"Mbola hita taratra haingana, \nfa mety tsy hampiditra anao rehefa lavi"
"tra."

#: src/onboarding.glade:383
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "fiarovana"

#: src/onboarding.glade:399
msgid ""
"The slightly safer option, \nbut will take much longer to authenticate"
" you"
msgstr ""
"Ny safidy somary azo antoka kokoa, \nfa haharitra ela kokoa vao hanama"
"rina anao"

#: src/onboarding.glade:442
msgid "Adding a face model"
msgstr "Manampy endrika endrika"

#: src/onboarding.glade:461
msgid ""
"To authenticate you Ubuntu Hello needs to save a model of your face to"
" recognise you. Press the Scan button below to start the facial scan."
msgstr ""
"Mba hanamarinana anao Ubuntu Hello dia mila mitahiry modely amin'ny ta"
"vanao mba hamantarana anao. Tsindrio ny bokotra Scan eto ambany hanomb"
"ohana ny scan facial."

#: src/onboarding.glade:538
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Mandalo aloha"

#: src/onboarding.glade:544
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-"
"hello add"
msgstr ""
"Afaka manampy modely tarehy bebe kokoa ianao any aoriana any amin'ny S"
"ettings na miaraka amin'ny: sudo ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.glade:577 src/onboarding.glade:668
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Fametrahana webcam"

#: src/onboarding.glade:594
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Mitselatra ve ny émitteur infrarouge?"

#: src/onboarding.glade:612
msgid "yes"
msgstr "ENY"

#: src/onboarding.glade:629
msgid "no"
msgstr "tsy misy"

#: src/onboarding.glade:687
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available c"
"ameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list "
"of usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and clic"
"k Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia hikaroka ho azy ny rafitrao amin'ny fakan-tsary misy,"
" koa ataovy azo antoka fa mifandray ny webcam-nao. Aorian'ny fisavana "
"dia hiseho ny lisitry ny webcam azo ampiasaina. Fidio izay tianao hamp"
"iasaina ary tsindrio Next."

#: src/onboarding.glade:709
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Mitsapa ny webcam-nao, andraso azafady..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:761
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Misintona rakitra angona"

#: src/onboarding.glade:780
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be"
" able to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the "
"download progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia mila angon-drakitra famantarana famantarana tarehy te"
"lo efa voaofana mba hahafantarana anao, izay ho alaina izao. Azonao je"
"rena eto ambany ny fivoaran'ny fampidinana."

#: src/onboarding.glade:801
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Manomboka misintona..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:850
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Tongasoa eto Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:866
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Malagasy Bible"

#: src/onboarding.glade:887
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Ity mpamosavy ity dia hitarika anao amin'ny fizotry ny fanamboarana ar"
"y manitsy ho azy ny Ubuntu Hello ho anao. Tsindrio manaraka raha hanoh"
"y."

#: src/onboarding.glade:911
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "hanafoana"

#: src/onboarding.glade:931
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Manaraka"

#: src/onboarding.glade:956
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Vita ny fanamboarana"

